<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Request to change the e-mail</title>
</head>
<body>
<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
    A request to change the e-mail of your account <strong>{$userEntity->username}</strong> to <strong>{$newEmail}</strong> was made.
    The e-mail changes only after the link sent to the new address is confirmed.
</p>

<p>
    If it was not you, please change your password right away.
</p>
</body>
</html>
